 "profile": {
  "paragraphs": [
   "SDL builds software that local government departments use to run daily operations. The company frames the work as digitising processes and connecting departments to one another.",
   "SDL Connect, the cloud product, is available nationwide and pairs government operations with resident connectivity. GIS mapping integration sits among its listed capabilities. A separate desktop suite is purpose-built for New Jersey. The company also sells highly configurable websites for local government.",
   "SDL says it has more than 26 years of expertise and over 260 local government clients. It says the solution can be fully implemented in as little as six weeks. Case studies describe the Muskegon County Road Commission, which had no system for processing online services. Another describes Toms River digitising its fire prevention inspections. The company describes its roots as being in GIS."
  ],
